# Data Collection and Web Scraping

This resource contains the web scraping and data collection implementation used in the Tri-Model Smart Justice Framework (TMSJ).

The module was developed to collect:

* Saudi commercial court decisions from the Ministry of Justice portal.
* Saudi laws and regulations from the Bureau of Experts portal.

The collected datasets were used to build the legal corpus utilized throughout the TMSJ framework.

Google Drive Access:

https://drive.google.com/file/d/1hcV0R49ejdXKleGFDw4tRfTJMGze1MRw/view?usp=sharing

The web scraping system serves as the data collection stage of the TMSJ pipeline and provides the raw legal resources used during preprocessing, training, and evaluation.

